### Add student 101
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 101,
  "studentName": "Gauri Mishra",
  "email": "gauri@example.com",
  "courseName": "B.Tech CSIT",
  "programmingScore": 82,
  "mathematicsScore": 91,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Python", "SQL"]
}

### Add student 102 (programming below 50, maths at least 75)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 102,
  "studentName": "Aanya Sharma",
  "email": "aanya@example.com",
  "courseName": "B.Tech CSE",
  "programmingScore": 42,
  "mathematicsScore": 78,
  "technicalSkills": ["Python", "HTML"]
}

### Add student 103 (same skill set as student 101)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 103,
  "studentName": "Riya Verma",
  "email": "riya@example.com",
  "courseName": "B.Tech CSIT",
  "programmingScore": 74,
  "mathematicsScore": 68,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Python", "SQL"]
}

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Get student by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/101

### Search by ID, email, or course (use one parameter at a time)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?studentId=101

### Search by email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?email=aanya@example.com

### Search by course
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?course=CSIT

### Merit list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/merit-list

### Students with the same technical skill set (101 and 103 should group together)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/same-skills

### Programming below 50 and maths >= 75 (should include student 102)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/programming-needs-improvement

### Update student 102's scores and skills
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/102/scores-skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programmingScore": 58,
  "mathematicsScore": 84,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "MySQL"]
}

### Delete student 103
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/103
